### GET All Companies
GET https://localhost:7001/api/v1/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET Company by ID  
GET https://localhost:7001/api/v1/companies/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST Create Company
POST https://localhost:7001/api/v1/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Company",
  "code": "NEW",
  "description": "New company description",
  "parentCompanyId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### POST Assign User to Company
POST https://localhost:7001/api/v1/users/assign-to-company
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keycloakUserId": "test-user-123",
  "companyId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "role": "COMPANY_USER"
}

### GET User Companies
GET https://localhost:7001/api/v1/users/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}rio.Identity.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5036

GET {{Grafirio.Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

